00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:08,880
Express measurement quantity using decimal number

2
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:18,880
We learn together how to write length measurement in decimal number form as follows:

3
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:26,000
Fill in blank

4
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:47,330
Method: First convert 6 m 4 dm to mixed number 6 and 4 tenths m then continue convert to decimal number 6.4 m

5
00:00:47,330 --> 00:00:59,260
So: 6 m 4 dm = 6.4 m

